# text_id = 1589
# text = It is no easy thing in Belfast to find men of different religious creeds agreeing upon any public question ; but upon the question now before the House I am in a position to say that the great mass of the people of all religious creeds are absolutely of one opinion , and that that opinion is against the Corporation .
