# text = The right hon . Gentleman knew that there were certain privileges given to the Crown on condition that it did not abuse them ; but if in every case , agrarian or political , Roman Catholics were to be excluded , that was jury - packing of as disgraceful a sort as if it had been done under Jeffreys or Scroggs .
