# text_id = 1634
# text = In the indictment of this trial , one of the speeches upon which the Crown mainly rely , and for which I am being tried , is a speech made at Arklow , County Wicklow , in which I denounced personally , and by name , in what I will admit was the strongest language , the conduct of Captain Hamilton .
