# text_id = 1640
# text = He wished to point out , with all gravity , that these hon . Members had been detained in prison for six months , not in pursuance of any judicial process , or the verdict of any jury , or sentence following upon a trial , not even because of a committal by the humblest magistrate in the Realm .
