# text_id = 1641
# text = The House will , therefore , bear in mind , in the figures I have to lay before it for 1881 – 2 and 1881 –2 , that the account of Revenue has been increased by £ 2,000,000 , owing to the Treasury Contribution in 1880 –1 , and by £ 3,000,000 owing to the Treasury Contribution for 1881 –2 .
