# text = Statistics showed in these a startling disproportion between England and Scotland , taking into consideration the numbers of population , and these figures were not to be attributed in any degree to the manners or character of the people , but mainly or exclusively to the superior system which existed in Scotland for the detection and prosecution of crime .
