# text_id = 1696
# text = The Constabulary authorities report that an extra force of police was drafted into Youghal in 1888 , and again in 1889 , with a view to preventing a demonstration which there was reason to believe it was contemplated holding to commemorate the anniversary of the death of a civilian during the riot referred to in the third paragraph of the question .
