# text_id = 1699
# text = On his trial , Mr. Tighe , who is not associated at all with the National Party , who is a Justice of the Peace for Mayo and Sligo , and who is High Sheriff of Mayo , declared that Mr. Nally had always been , so far as he knew , an industrious and respectable member of society .
