# text_id = 1722
# text = I find that some persons , whose frame of mind it is very difficult for me to appreciate , seem to take a pleasure in imputing the basest motives for the public actions of men with whom they happen to differ , and suggest that I only joined the Government with a preconceived determination to leave it at the first opportunity .
