# text_id = 1724
# text = He ( Mr. Jesse Collings ) hoped that it would continue to receive more and more attention on the part of the House , and that Parliaments , in the future , would conceive it to be their duty to spend a much larger amount of time than they had hitherto done in the contemplation and solution of these social problems .
