# text_id = 1725
# text = I am sure the hon . Member for Londonderry ( Mr. Lewis ) and the hon . Member for Southwark ( Mr. Thorold Rogers ) have some good reasons for putting these Questions on the Paper ; but I hope they will forgive me for saying that it is much to be regretted that Questions of this character should be asked .
