# text = The noble Lord ( Lord Randolph Churchill ) condemned what he called the indefinite nature of the proposal of the Government ; but he himself was so undecided that , whereas he put down an Amendment that the meetings should be on Mondays , Tuesdays , and Thursdays , he now changed his mind , and proposed only Tuesdays and Fridays .
