# text = If the Home Secretary could see his way to state that he abided by the words of the Prime Minister , he ( Mr. Parnell ) would be quite willing to withdraw the Amendment and to leave the matter to be settled on the Report , otherwise he should feel compelled to ask the Committee to divide upon the Amendment .
