# text = MR. MITCHELL HENRY said , the Committee ought to be aware that there was a Department of the Board of Works which was specially charged with the duty of looking after the ancient monuments of Ireland ; so that if the Amend - mend were withdrawn , it did not follow that proper care would not be taken of those monuments .
