# text_id = 1745
# text = He was unaware whether the noble Marquess was present at that banquet ; but if it were true that the maintenance of these Acts had been a connivance at immorality , on the Benches opposite they would find those who were the connivers , and the greatest conniver of all was the Prime Minister , who had just left his place .
