# text = They would probably that Session hear something about the Malt Tax — a mere flash in the pan ; but when a proposal was made for a practical remedy for what was known to be a farmers ' grievance , it was astonishing how quiet and how anxious to wait for leisure became the farmers ' friends in that House .
