# text = In the case of the former the rating is of such a character that any deficiency in the value is small ; whereas in the case of the rural ratepayers , they are saddling themselves with a heavy burden , and if the rate of interest can possibly be reduced to 3 ⅛ it will be a substantial relief to them .
