# text_id = 1780
# text = The hon . Member spoke of the wages as a miserable pittance ; but there was one thing he did not mention — that the women worked usually not more than four days , sometimes five days , a - week , and therefore the wages represented considerably more than would appear from the speech of the hon . Member .
