# text_id = 1782
# text = The Militia was really tested by the numbers that came up for inspection , excluding , of course , the Irish Militia ; and he found that , last year , in England and Scotland , only 80,000 men came up , 7,000 being absent without leave , who were practically gone , while 3,000 were absent with leave .
