# text = MR. MARE STEWART said , that the hon . Member for Liskeard ( Mr. Courtney ) had informed the Committee that he came from the West Coast of England ; but he had not , at the same time , informed them of the great difference which existed between the West Coast of England and some parts of the Scotch Coast .
