# text_id = 1785
# text = A distinction was drawn between ecclesiastical and non-ecclesiastical funds , and it was provided that all such ecclesiastical purposes seemed still beneficial within the limits of the City were still to have the encouragement of the Charity Funds , the balance to be applied , under the management of the Ecclesiastical Commissioners , to ecclesiastical purposes throughout the Metropolis .
