# text = If any argument were needed to convince the House and the country that owners were ratepayers to a very large extent , he would only refer hon . Members to that admirable Report written by the present Chancellor of the Exchequer in the year 1870 , which dealt with all the complicated questions that surrounded the reform of local rating .
