# text = If they are inferior , so much the stronger a case , it appears to me , is made out for asserting the efficiency of voluntary effort for the support of Presbyterian Churches in Scotland , and for asserting that the effect of the endowments which it receives is simply to depress the private liberality of individuals connected with it .
