# text_id = 1836
# text = All the three cases which have been laid before the Committee are cases in which prosecutions have been instituted on the ground of conspiracy , and means have been resorted to in order to procure convictions in which , rightly or wrongly , the Irish people have no confidence , but look upon them with the greatest amount of suspicion .
