# text_id = 1837
# text = The right hon . Gentleman wound up his statement by a declaration to the Committee that no imaginable Bill could be introduced on the subject of redistribution which would not give rise to Party contention ; and , therefore , it was impossible for the Government , under those circumstances , to take the course of introducing a Bill .
