# text_id = 1840
# text = It was perfectly practicable for persons in London to converse with others in Liverpool ; in fact , people in Liverpool did now converse with people in Manchester , and people in Sunderland , since the hon . Member for Sunderland ( Mr. Storey ) called attention to the subject , were able to hold a conversation with people in Newcastle .
