# text_id = 1844
# text = It was pointed out that in bringing a Common Law case into a County Court the workman would be restricted to the same £ 150 limit as if he were enforcing his statutory claim ; but in his answer to the hon . and learned Member for York ( Mr. Lockwood ) , the right hon . Gentleman denied this .
