# text_id = 1845
# text = The course suggested by the hon . and learned Gentleman opposite ( Mr. Ambrose ) as to inserting a clause in the interest of the Deputy Registrar may or not be regular ; but it certainly would be most irregular to attempt to stop the second reading by arguments which in no sense go to the merits of the Bill .
