# text_id = 1849
# text = My hon . Friend ( Sir Joseph Pease ) , who has charge of the Bill , said that , as far as the question of area was concerned , he would be willing , when the Bill got into Committee , to amend it in the direction I propose , provided he was sure that was the wish of the House and of the people of the country .
