# text = What had been said by the hon . Member for Wolverhampton ( Mr. H. H. Fowler ) , by the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Bradford ( Mr. W. E. Forster ) , and by the hon . Gentleman the Member for Londonderry ( Mr. Lewis ) showed the enormous practical difficulties which they would have to confront in dealing with this question of the franchise by itself .
