# text_id = 1852
# text = In moving the reduction of the Vote by £ 500 my object is — and I trust the answer I may receive will save me from the necessity of putting the Committee to the trouble of division — is to call attention to the exceedingly shocking state of the prisons both in Cape Colony and other portions of our South African dominions under the authority of the High Commissioner .
