# text_id = 1853
# text = I have received statements in writing from Robert Fry and Edgar Hunt containing specific and detailed allegations that Mr. Brame , the Postmaster of Ryde , had given an order that all letters addressed to John Rabson , clerk in the Ryde Post Office , were to be detained , and that on the 26th of October Mr. Brame actually opened , read , and re-sealed a letter addressed to Rabson .
