# text = The policy of the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Mid Lothian and his supporters , however , was neither to bully nor to bribe , but to let the Irish people govern themselves , and , therefore , they opposed this Bill for this , among other reasons , that it was rejected by the 85 Nationalist members of Ireland , and only supported by the 15 landlordist Members .
