# text = If he wanted any confirmation of that , he should have ample in the testimony of the Endowed Schools Commissioners of 1873 , for they stated that the country was not prepared for the measure , which was literally hurried through Parliament without scarcely any examination , and nothing came out more clearly than the justice of the charge that the Endowed Schools Bill of 1869 was a skeleton Bill .
