# text = We are , of course , aware that it is not competent at this stage of the Bill to discuss an Amendment which we are informed will be moved in Committee on behalf of the Government ; but I may be permitted to say that the change of front indicated by that Amendment is far more complete than the right hon . and learned Gentleman is disposed to admit .
