# text_id = 1859
# text = As regards the delay which has occurred , I can only say that I regret that there should have been delay in a matter of such great importance ; and I agree with the hon . Gentleman that , this question of technical instruction having been permanently raised , it is of vital importance that some early action should be taken in the direction indicated , especially in the Metropolis .
