# text_id = 1861
# text = No doubt , as a matter of taste , most serious objections might be raised to the modus operandi of the newspaper in question ; but he was prepared to say distinctly , having been engaged for four days with three or four distinguished men in making an investigation , that the truth of the statements made by The Pall Mall Gazette was substantially proved to the satisfaction of the Committee .
