# text_id = 1862
# text = They should repudiate the Court , and should seek to destroy it , as Englishmen , generations ago , sought to destroy the Star Chamber ; and I tell the Government that if ever it should come to my lot to be summoned before one of these Secret Courts to give evidence against anything that has happened or is happening I should distinctly refuse to attend such an inquiry .
