# text = The attention of his right hon . and learned Friend was suddenly called to the matter , and he did not have any opportunity of studying it closely , and he informed the right hon . and learned Member that he did not see any harm in it , as he understood that it was only an amplification of the Amendment of the hon . Member for Limerick County .
