# text = They had bet - ter houses than almost any of the Races in South Africa , they had adopted our dress and civilization and religion , and perhaps nothing had more tended to discourage the advance of civilization in South Africa than the attacks of the Boers upon this Tribe , by which the progress of civilization had been not only retarded , but driven back for many years .
