# text = When he observed that evening the aspect of right hon . Gentlemen sitting on the same Bench with the Prime Minister , he could not help thinking that , delightful as place and power might be , he ( Mr. Long ) would not , humble individual though he was , exchange positions with any of those right hon . Gentlemen , considering the feelings which they must have entertained .
