# text_id = 1868
# text = It is further to be observed that , while in the first instance the guarantee is , apparently , a voluntary one , there are some very singular provisions contained in the Bill , which , as I read it , are intended to recoup the people who have undertaken the guarantee , and these are provisions which do not seem to be consistent with the idea of a National Church .
