# text_id = 1869
# text = MR. H. T. DAVENPORT ( Staffordshire , Leek ) asked the Under Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs , What are the facilities which this Government are prepared to afford at the coming Paris Exhibition to English exhibitors ; and , whether he is aware of the importance which they attach to the appointment by their Government of some person to assist and advise them and to protect their interests ?
