# text_id = 1871
# text = We have got what used to be considered fairly efficient education for all ; but we who have the subject continually before us see that the improvements made are far from sufficient , and that if we do not want to lose a great part of that which we have obtained by the expenditure of these £ 3,000,000 or £ 4,000,000 of grants by the State , we must go further .
