# text_id = 1873
# text = It is — I will not say a corner — but a remote district of the country , and a crowd of turbulent and unpaid soldiery , that have brought about these great misfortunes ; but , my Lords , you must not be distracted from the pursuance of a great national policy by accidents of this kind and temporary circumstances , which you may rest assured will disappear .
