# text_id = 1875
# text = They could not raise their agricultural produce at so low a rate as if they had Free Trade ; and he would say to those hon . Members who desired a return to Protection , that they ought to be on their guard , as the farmers of this country were , as a body , thoroughly of opinion that they would not be able to thrive except under Free Trade .
