# text_id = 1877
# text = The Attorney General for Ireland is most anxious that a Catholic priest in Galway shall be imprisoned ; but when an agent or instrument in the hands of the landlords strikes down an opponent , and ought to be tried for the act the right hon . and learned Gentleman refuses to take action , and thereby does what is calculated to bring the law in Ireland into contempt .
