# text_id = 1880
# text = It was easy to see how that value had accrued ; for , in the course of generations , successive tenants had built a homestead and outbuildings of a comfortable and superior order ; and he undertook to say that anybody wanting a house of that kind in the neighbourhood of Londonderry would make a prudent investment if he paid £ 150 for the tenant right of that holding .
