# text_id = 1881
# text = The result was that Commissioners were sent down ; but , contrary to what was done by the Commissioners in the cases of Boston , Canterbury , Chester , Gloucester , Macclesfield , Oxford , and Sandwich , the other places mentioned in the Schedule , they found that a hasty conclusion had been come to by the Judges , and their Report was eminently favourable to the character of Knaresborough .
