# text_id = 1882
# text = He quoted , with admirable effect , the speech made by the noble Lord the Member for South Paddington ( Lord Randolph Churchill ) last year , in which that noble Lord showed conclusively that the proportion or amount of even the normal expenditure and strength of the country must depend upon the policy of the Government and of successive Governments , and upon the view they took of their responsibilities .
