# text = MR. ANDERSON said , he had understood from what took place on the previous occasion that the hon . Baronet the Member for South Kensington ( Sir Algernon Borthwick ) had placed on the Paper an Amendment excluding a particular clause from the Bill , and was prepared to move it on the understand - ing that the hon . and learned Attorney General would insert an Amendment later on .
