# text_id = 1886
# text = The working classes there , amongst whom there was a large number of Roman Catholics , were disposed sometimes to be rather vicious in their conduct , and in March last some girls who were coming out of a Roman Catholic Church were attacked by some persons of this class ; one girl was thrown down and injured so much that she was afterwards unable to walk without a crutch .
