# text_id = 1888
# text = The hon . and gallant Gentleman proposed the clause on the ground that , in his opinion , many men enlisted when they were under the influence of drink and did not know what they were really doing , or , at any rate , at a moment of excitement , and that , therefore , £ 10 was a great deal too much to be paid for their discharge .
