# text_id = 1894
# text = I have had a good deal to do with elections , directly and indirectly , in one way and another , and it has frequently fallen to my lot to meet large numbers of men under somewhat exciting circumstances ; and I can testify that I never felt this great nervousness unless when the excitement of intoxicating drink has been added to that of Party zeal and political passion .
