# text_id = 1896
# text = This Budget was last year converted into a Regular Estimate , which showed a result of £ 67,615,205 Revenue , and £ 67,285,690 Expenditure , or a surplus of £ 329,515 ; and in the spring of this year , when this Regular Estimate was converted into a stated account , the result was — Revenue , £ 68,484,666 ; Expenditure , £ 69,667,615 ; showing a deficit of £ 1,182,949 .
