# text = In the particular case to which he alludes , however , I think he is mistaken in saying that the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Mid Lothian ( Mr. W. E. Gladstone ) was against the principle of the Bill ; as a matter of fact , I think the right hon . Gentleman was in favour of the Bill , and supported it and voted for it .
