# text_id = 1901
# text = He did not wish to enter upon these matters , which involved questions of theological controversy , which were always painful subjects to discuss in that House ; but he felt bound to meet the observations of the hon . I Gentleman , and he hoped the hon . Member would see that he had endeavoured to do so in the spirit in which he had brought the matter forward .
