# text_id = 1902
# text = You would have a good security for that in cases where the small proprietors have been able either to accumulate money of their own by their own industry or where they are able to obtain credit from , perhaps , members of their own family or from the landlord , or , in a reasonable degree , from a public fund such as that it is proposed they shall borrow from .
