# text_id = 1906
# text = In another case , in the village of Currans , the constable who ought to be on protection duty outside the house of a farmer named Murphy was seated before the kitchen fire in the company of Miss Murphy , when , perhaps , in the course of demonstrating to her some scientific experiment or other his gun exploded , and the charge entered the arm of her brother .
