# text_id = 1907
# text = With regard to manual training in elementary schools , to which reference had been made by the hon . Baronet the Member for the University of London ( Sir John Lubbock ) , he did not think it would be advisable to introduce it ; but he did think that it would be well to train the bodies and develop the physical health of the pupils by means of gymnasia .
