# text_id = 1908
# text = There were difficulties in the way ; all of them were influenced more or less by Party considerations , and it was not pleasant for them to assail their Leaders ; but really , if they could not insure to the House of Commons the security indicated by his hon . Friend , they would be bound to have a still higher regard than hitherto as to the composition of Governments .
