# text_id = 1911
# text = I submit that in the commonest justice the House should be allowed to go to a division ; and I shall not hesitate to place it on record that if hon . Members , by pressing this Motion , prevent the House from going to a division , they will do so because they dare not take that opinion of the House which they profess themselves anxious to have .
