# text_id = 1912
# text = There was , indeed , nothing more remarkable in the able speech of the right hon . Gentleman than the sturdy way in which he declared , on behalf of the Government and their supporters , that they were determined to trust the people , and to place the County Councils in future by direct election and not by indirect and secondary election in contact with the people of the county .
