# text = Friend must recall how , when Lord Brougham used those words , he who was the most entitled to speak on behalf of the Bar of England sprang to his feet and protested against that saying , declaring that that was not the duty of counsel , but that it was their duty to fight with the weapons of a warrior and not with the dagger of an assassin .
