# text_id = 1915
# text = This Bill was an attempt to subsidize one class of traders in this country at the public expense ; it was an attempt to fine local communities for efforts to purify themselves , and improve their own position ; it was an attempt to strengthen , fortify , and perpetuate a system against which public opinion was steadily rising and would rise still higher ; and what was that system ?
