# text_id = 1917
# text = At present , licences to sell beer off the premises could be obtained by taking out a wholesale licence at a cost of £ 3 6 s . 1¾d. , and a retail licence at a cost of £ 1 2s . O½d. , or a total of £ 4 8 s. 2¼d. ; but the question arose whether this sum was sufficiently large to insure his carrying out the requirements ?
