# text = This evidence , then , I say , not taking any part by itself , but taking the whole of it , must carry the conviction to most reasonable people that , at all events , rack - renting in Ireland has prevailed very extensively , and , I will say for myself , much more extensively than I had any idea of at the time the Land Act was passed .
