# text = It was his impression that it might be said , and with some truth and justice , that the troubles which now existed in Egypt were , to a certain extent , raised rather by the upper classes than by the lower classes ; but they must take care lest , in the future , circumstances should arise which would cause discontent in the midst of the people of Egypt .
