# text = Would the noble Lord tell the House of Commons that he and his Colleagues , including such men as the heads of the Intelligence Department and the Director of Naval Ordnance — Admiral Hornby , Admiral Hewitt , and so forth , were agreed that at the present moment the forces of England were such as the people of this country would expect them to be when a war broke out .
