# text_id = 1922
# text = If the right hon . and learned Lord Advocate would at once rise for the purpose of addressing the House , I see no reason why the Motion for the adjournment of the debate should be pressed ; but I think that a very powerful case has been presented to the House , and one that it may be very difficult for the right hon . and learned Gentleman to answer .
