# text_id = 1923
# text = It was all very well to say that the tenants had suffered heavily in some instances ; but there were cases of quite as great hardship among the landlords , and there were many cases within his own knowledge , where rentals had come down from thousands a - year to a few pounds , and where men who were dependent upon rentals for their subsistence had been reduced to beggary .
