# text = Well , Sir , I am afraid that , after what we have heard from some Gentlemen opposite , and , most of all , from the right hon . Gentleman the late Home Secretary ( Sir R. Assheton Cross ) , I shall make a very dull , unexciting , and uninteresting speech ; for , unlike him , I do not mean to accuse anybody of anything .
