# text_id = 1926
# text = As he said , the only logical conclusion they could come to in regard to the agitation against the House of Lords was to support the hon . Member if they were really in earnest ; and if they were not , let them throw him over , and show the country that this was only a humbugging agita - tion which they were afraid to carry to a practical issue .
