# text_id = 1931
# text = That was the first time that repressive legislation had been proposed , not as an extreme expedient to enable the Government to cope with a special emergency , but as a permanent surrender of all their Constitutional rights , and as a disability under which 5,000,000 of the inhabitants of one portion of the so - called United Kingdom were expected to live at all times in loyalty and contentment .
