# text_id = 1934
# text = I must say that the attack of the right hon . and learned Gentleman , though he has made it under the pressure of conscience and the sharpness of its stings , which , he found , would have been perfectly intolerable unless he had brought this Motion forward , is one of the feeblest attacks that I have ever witnessed against the policy and the proceedings of an Executive Government .
