# text_id = 1935
# text = We believe that there is a great mass of people in the country who want to go about their business in peace and quietness ; we believe that the farmers of Ireland , if loft alone , are beginning slowly to settle down and to appreciate the great advantages which — whether justly or unjustly we are not now arguing — have been conferred upon them by the Land Act .
