# text_id = 1936
# text = Although he did not come to the same conclusion , he desired also that this matter should be treated not as a purely legal question , but as one of common sense ; and without entering into any consideration of what might possibly be the course of parties concerned , he pointed out that there was a general principle on which the House might be advised not to accept this clause .
