# text_id = 1937
# text = I think that the Railway Company are ill - advised , considering the beneficial Amendments which were made in the Bill when it was first brought before the House , in insisting upon the Toll Schedules at all ; because if they did not claim the right of levying tolls on produce , the opposition which is being offered to the Bill would have been to a great extent disarmed .
