# text_id = 1938
# text = It is very hard that he cannot profess himself a Member of the Liberal Party without seeing a policy pursued that drops the honour of his country into the dirt ; that has cost the sacrifice of thousands and thousands of lives ; and that has brought this great Empire into a position so difficult that it is almost impossible to see how it is to find its way out .
