# text_id = 1939
# text = If hon . Gentlemen opposite , instead of descending to the low , vulgar glee caused by bloodshed in this country , would feel the solemnity of the responsibility pressing upon them , they would take the wiser , more prudent , and more philanthropic policy of entering into negotiations , not with the Khartoum Arabs , but with the Native tribes along the coast of the Red Sea .
