# text_id = 1942
# text = When the right hon . and learned Attorney General for Ireland ( Mr. Holmes ) said that he had made no admission that this clause might be used for the purpose of getting hold of the case of a prisoner , he was technically right ; but when he said that it would be grossly unfair so to use it , he practically admitted that it could so be used .
