# text = If he had had , he would have felt that the natural construction of the clause was that which the Attorney General ( Sir Henry James ) had put upon it , and it would require a great deal more argument than he had yet heard to twist it so as to make it bear the construction suggested by the hon . Member for Tipperary ( Mr. Dillon ) .
