# text_id = 1946
# text = After all , there was strong reason for supposing that two - thirds of the garrisons were people of the Soudan , who would probably be very glad to join the Mahdi ; and he saw no reason why they should not be permitted and encouraged to join the Mahdi , who was , for the time at all events , the Representative of the Native element in the Soudan .
