# text_id = 1948
# text = It was far better , in his opinion , that University education in Ireland should be spread as far as possible over the whole country , because if the Colleges were concentrated in two or three of the large towns , the poorer classes , who could not afford to send their sons to distant places of education , would be practically excluded from the benefits they might otherwise receive .
