# text = I will not express an opinion upon the point ; but I have in my hand a written opinion of one of the most eminent naval men in this country , a gentleman whom I asked particularly to be good enough to go down and inspect this torpedo , because he had expressed an opinion in private against the advantages to be derived from it in time of war .
