# text = He would repeat the remark of the hon . Member for Sligo , that this was a case in which it behoved the Government to be extremely particular as to the manner in which they acted ; and he might point out that the arrangement with regard to Warwick had created a considerable amount of interest throughout the country , a proof that it was not looked upon with complete satisfaction .
