# text = He was a member of the Land League , and he thoroughly approved of its policy ; and if the Secretary of State for the Home Department attempted to tell him that , because he did belong to the Land League and agreed in its policy , he favoured assassination , he would be compelled to tell the right hon . Gentleman that he was deliberately stating what was false .
