# text_id = 1960
# text = Such acts are doubly a scandal when they are done at the instance of a Power which has disregarded all legitimate representations we have made , which oppresses and maltreats its own subjects , and which takes umbrage at the publication in this free country of a journal which contains nothing but a fair and honest statement of the facts which daily occur in the dominions of the Sultan .
