# text_id = 1966
# text = Whatever might be the merits or demerits of the policy which we had pursued in the past with regard to Germany , on which he reserved his opinion , the question we had now to consider was what , in the actual position of affairs , was for our own interests and those of the Sultan of Zanzibar and the civilized nations who were anxious to put down the Slave Trade ?
