# text = He had risen to ask , as a point of Order , whether the paper from which the right hon . Gentleman was reading had been laid on the Table of the House , and the right hon . Gentleman had referred him to the Blue Book — or rather what had been a Blue Book — which he ( Mr. Cavendish Bentinck ) then held in his hand .
