# text_id = 1968
# text = The hon . Member who had just sat down remarked that they wanted in that House an hon . Member who was an experienced railway man to state the case of railway employés to the House ; but he must say that after the speech of the hon . Member the cause of the railway employés had lost nothing by the manner in which he had presented their case .
