# text = The terms of the new scheme were practically arranged before Christmas last , and with the exception of one or two points as to the future appointment of trustees , had the approval of those interested , and of the hon . Member for Leicester and the noble Lord the Member for the Melton Division who had , in conjunction with myself , brought the matter before the Commissioners .
