# text_id = 1975
# text = But if we left the initiative under these two heads we should not do justice to an important section of the House — namely , to the section antagonistic to the question under debate ; and therefore it is I propose that the Mover or Seconder of an Amendment to the Motion before the House shall have equal right to the Mover or Seconder of the Motion to propose the closure .
