# text_id = 1980
# text = VISCOUNT BURY asked Her Majesty 's Government , Under whose authority would be placed the fish market which it was proposed to establish in the International Fisheries Exhibition ; and whether the stalls , costermongers ' carts , and other usual adjuncts of a fish market would be so regulated as to minimize the inconvenience which must be caused by the establishment of such a market in a West End thoroughfare ?
