# text_id = 1981
# text = There was a pier there previously , which was not , of course , so capacious as the new harbour ; but the result of this expenditure of £ 10,000 has not been so satisfactory as the Inspectors of Fisheries would like , because now that the harbour is near its completion they report that it will not be able to accommodate vessels drawing more than 5 feet of water .
