# text_id = 1984
# text = My right hon . Friend will deal with that question in the course of the debate , and on the Motion that you , Sir , do leave the Chair , if it appears necessary to the House ; but I am not aware that a private meeting of the Members of a Party renders it necessary that a grave and serious statement should be made to the House of Commons .
