# text = They will dissever themselves from nothing that he has done ; and now , watching all that he has done , they claim that , if the House passes this vote for the reduction of the salary of the Attorney General , the censure shall not rest upon him alone , and one and all declare that they will stand by his side , and ask to share in his condemnation .
