# text = The whole action taken was taken in entire independence of the Government ; and , as far as I am concerned , was simply giving effect to the opinion which I had expressed to the House when Sir Stafford Northcote gave Notice that some Motion would be proposed by the Opposition — namely , that any debate and Division on the French Agreement would be most injurious to the public interests .
