# text = If the Government had understood the Bill they were dealing with they would have idealized that that was our object ; and if the right hon . Gentleman the Home Secretary would , when asked a question , give an answer instead of forcing a Division , and would , moreover , give reasons for his refusal , I think it would be very much better for all of us .
