# text = Therefore , he was asking the House to sanction no new legislation , but merely to enable a number of private individuals , who had done the public service by devoting their time and money to an attempt to solve the question , to provide , as a joint stock company , further money , with a view of solving the question whether the Tunnel could be made or not .
