# text_id = 1996
# text = It seems to me in the highest degree un - business - like that , having spent enormous sums on our Naval Dockyards , and having spent millions of money in setting up plant with which to build our ships , we should not make proper use of that plant , but should go to private yards to get work done which could be equally well done in our Royal Dockyards .
