# text_id = 1998
# text = The distinct account given to us by Lord Dufferin is that the Egyptian procedure is in essential the French procedure , that this preliminary process and the formation of the dossier , as it has been called , is the process that prevails in the French Courts , and though it may be alien to English notions it i3 familiar and prevalent in a great part of the countries of Europe .
