# text_id = 2000
# text = I speak in the hearing of a great many hon . and learned Friends , and I speak the opinion of the Profession , when I say that from beginning to end these two Acts were signal failures — that they have cost this country a great deal more money than they are worth , and that they have done little better than to establish one or two not unimportant sinecures .
