# text = DR . TANNER ( Cork Co. , Mid ) asked the Secretary of State for War , Whether Army Medical Officers of the Retired List re-employed will receive the same pay , allowances , and military status as other officers of their rank ; and , whether their additional service will count for increased pension when compulsorily retired by age ; and , if not , what advantages they will derive ?
