# text = It was , however , a matter of small importance to him whether the House had interfered in the past or not , for he thought that in the future they would have to interfere , and the sooner the right hon . Gentleman thought more of the rights of humanity and less of the rights of property the better it would be for the Conservative Party in Scotland .
