# text_id = 2004
# text = Next , as justifying my position that we must move with the greatest circumspection , I would point out the very important fact as to the rents , that the rents charged for these cottages , so far as built , vary from 8d. to 1s . per week ; and in one Union only — I believe near Dublin — the rent amounts to 1s . 6d. a - week .
