# text = It might , or might not , be desirable to put into the Bill a definition of " dwellinghouse " such as that proposed by the hon . Member for East Sussex ; but if they did put a definition at all in the Bill , it ought to be one which would express the real state of the law as now established by the decisions in the Registration Courts .
