# text_id = 2009
# text = Well , no doubt that was possible ; but certainly , so far as he knew , in the North of Ireland at any rate , they were not at all likely to be imposed upon ; and he felt tolerably confident that the farmers , who formed a large proportion of the baronial sessions , were not likely to undertake any guarantee which was not likely to benefit themselves .
