# text_id = 2011
# text = He would be more than human if it were not so ; and , therefore , with all deference , I submit that it would be more satisfactory to the public , and I venture to think more satisfactory to the gentlemen concerned , that while they are Members , or Associated Members , of the Ordnance Committee they should cease to be members of any firm of ordnance manufacturers .
