# text_id = 2012
# text = So far as I am aware , there is no immediate prospect of any legislation of the character indicated by the Question of the hon . Member ; and , looking to the very able and exhaustive Reports of the last Royal Commission , on agricultural employment , I see no reason to institute any further inquiries , which could not , in my opinion , be confined to Scotland .
