# text_id = 2014
# text = They all deplored , as much as the hon . Gentleman the Member for Flintshire ( Mr. S. Smith ) the condition of the streets of the Metropolis ; and if a Bill of this kind was likely to be of any use at all anywhere , it would be in the Metropolis , which , however , the Mover said he was ready to eliminate , if necessary .
