# text_id = 2015
# text = It was , in the highest degree , important that that should be done , because the Votes which he understood would be asked for were the Supplemental Irish Votes , which raised the entire question of the extraordinary expenditure that had been going on in Ireland during the Excess — an expenditure which might lead to a very prolonged debate and to the closest and most clear examination .
