# text = But the obvious answer to that was that the class most interested and affected by the disability in question was not that which would be likely to spend their time in the writing of letters to the Lord Chancellor , or the Judge Advocate General ; and , therefore , the fact mentioned by the right hon . Gentleman was no proof that Sunday burial was not desired by that class .
