# text = He proposes to refer this and other Bills to a Hybrid Committee to be nominated by the House and the Committee of Selection , and to allow all Petitions against the Bill presented not later than six days before the meeting of the Committee to be referred to the Committee , giving the Petitioners the right of being heard against the Bill by counsel , agents , and witnesses .
