# text = In concluding the remarks he had to make , he would also express the hope that , having gone over all the points of objection which the hon . and learned Member for Chatham had stated with so much moderation , the hon . and learned Member would be willing to withdraw his Amendment , and allow the sum of £ 5,000 now asked for on account to be taken .
