# text_id = 2020
# text = In the first place , suppose it had come to the worst , and that the decree of King Theebaw , of which the Bombay Corporation complained , had been executed , it could only have given rise to a claim for damages , which might probably have been properly pressed by the Indian Government ; but that Government did not appear to have been very anxious to settle the difficulty .
