# text_id = 2021
# text = Why then do we not do what both sides say ought to be done — carry on the Ashbourne Act until next Session , either limit the amount to , say , £ 2,000,000 , or the time for which it is in force to the end of next Session , and thus fix statesmen on both sides to the determination then to work out a statesmanlike scheme of Land Purchase .
