# text = The Amendment was , however , pressed ; and , the House being in a hurry to get the Bill through Committee , it was adopted without discussion ; and when the Bill came on upon Report , the right hon . and learned Member for Londonderry County was not in his place ; and he ( Mr. J. Lowther ) again stated that he saw serious objections to the Amendment .
