# text = I think it is most monstrous to allow a man of such erratic mind , and with such a disposition to quarrel with his neighbours , to have any authority in these matters ; and I ask whether he will be allowed to administer the Crimes Act , and also whether the Government consider that his action in Kildare and Meath was in keeping with the position he holds ?
