# text = This was a very important medical question , and he thought , in any contemplated change of legislation , it was very desirable that the whole of this important subject should be inquired into , and provisions introduced which were in any way likely to meet the actual necessities of the case , before they proceeded in a manner which would close the subject practically for many years to come .
