# text = No opportunity appeared to have afforded itself to the Government of introducing that measure affecting the rating and affecting the powers of Corporations in Ireland to pay the expenses of contested Bills before Parliament ; but this Session , or next Session , or some other Session , the Government might feel itself bound to redeem this promise , as well as other promises they had made in a similar direction .
