# text = As one who had anxiously watched the Bill , as one who had used no language of indiscriminate eulogy towards it , and as one who had laboured to render it valuable for the Irish tenants , he thought it only just to say that he thought in its main and substantial character , for the protection of the Irish tenants , the Government had stood manfully by the Bill .
