# text_id = 2034
# text = Solicitors were deprived of their business if they did an act of professional duty of which the agitators did not approve ; auctioneers were commanded not to sell ; and so the game was carried on , one class of the community being persecuted after another , till no one knew how far he must consider himself denounced and what were the penalties which he might have to suffer .
