# text = A heavy demand was also made for compensation — 3,000 dollars a - year for four years — for damage to the plantations of German subjects , without a single item of particulars being given to the Samoan King , and that , notwithstanding that the punishment of offenders had nothing to do with the Samoan King , seeing that the cases were dealt with by the Consular Court .
