# text_id = 2037
# text = The arrangements with regard to France and with regard to the occupation were all practically minor points ; but what they all turned upon was the financial question ; and it was extremely important , not only in the interests of the country , but also in the interests of the Government , to put the House in a position of knowing something of the plans likely to be adopted .
