# text_id = 2038
# text = It would have been a satisfaction to those who professionally advised the Admiralty to have had the opportunity of designing a new yacht for the Queen ; but the Admiralty came to the conclusion that they ought to repair the old yacht , after the most thorough examination of the Victoria and Albert with her engines and boilers out , and on the deliberate advice of their professional advisers .
