# text_id = 2042
# text = But what has always struck me was that the Irish Parliament and Irish Executive , if they so desired , would have nothing more to do with the Receiver General than to send a couple of policemen , and firmly but gently convey that gentleman to Kingstown pier and put him on a steam packet for Holyhead — of course giving him a first - class ticket to London .
