# text_id = 2043
# text = I cannot understand the consistency of people who cry out against robbing the poor man of his beer — who never utter a whisper of condemation against those arbitrary landlords who refuse to have beershops or public - houses on their estates — but , at the same time , refuse to the inhabitants a voice in saying if they will or will not have these houses in their midst .
