# text_id = 2044
# text = MR. HOLMES said , that although the right hon . Gentleman the Chief Secretary had said that political economy had been banished to another sphere , he ( Mr. Holmes ) was glad to see that the right hon . Gentleman was still to some extent controlled by the principles of political economy , and still more glad that he had acknowledged the necessity of being guided by common sense .
