# text_id = 2045
# text = I had hoped to be able to place my views with regard to the subject in the form of a Bill providing machinery that would carry them into effect — because I entirely agree with the hon . and learned Gentleman who has just spoken , that the Bill as it stands is absolutely useless in that respect , and I doubt whether it would have any effect at all .
