# text_id = 2046
# text = He had , however , received a letter from his noble and learned Friend ( Lord Ashbourne ) , asking him ( Lord Fitzgerald ) to postpone his Motion on the subject ; and , as it would be discourteous to the noble and learned Lord if he were not to comply with his request , he would postpone proceeding with the question from tomorrow till Monday or Tuesday next .
