# text_id = 2049
# text = If it was assumed that a magistrate or Judge would unrighteously pronounce sentences under a law which had no application to the case , it did not matter what the law was ; but if it was assumed that this clause would be applied to a man , not for leaving his employment , and not for any unlawful object , the man could not possibly be brought within the Act .
