# text = MR. BAGGALLAY ( Lambeth , Brixton ) asked the First Commissioner of Works , If the Government would exclude from the Bill for the transfer of certain Parks to the Metropolitan Board of Works , the lands adjacent to Battersea Park , which constitute a separate estate from the Park , and which are mortgaged to the Public Works Commissioners for a sum amounting with accrued interest to about £ 173,000 ?
