# text = I was sorry to hear in one part of his speech a reference to Nonconformist chapels in Wales , which took the nature , I hardly like to call it of a sneer , but he did not treat with cordial respect those voluntary efforts of the people to provide themselves with a ministry , when the grossest abuses prevailed in the Church , to which they are entitled .
