# text = When the hon . Member made that remark , he said to a right hon . Colleague sitting beside him that if the Government contributed anything out of the Imperial funds for the relief of these very rates , it would be immediately said that it was not the population Government intended to relieve , but that their only object was to help the landlord out of his trouble .
