# text_id = 2056
# text = They could all recollect that during the time when the late Mr. Forster was Chief Secretary for Ireland , it was a very common and frequent thing for Irish Members to move , as then they had a right to move , the Adjournment of the House on some answer to a Question , and thus to start a long debate in which the Chief Secretary had to boar a part .
