# text_id = 2057
# text = The military authorities , as well as those of other countries , have since discovered that the bore is larger than is desired for the rifle of the future , and so , instead of pressing on the manufacture of a rifle , which might after all have proved not thoroughly good or efficient , they decided to admit their mistake , and say that they would have a smaller bore .
