# text = SIR HENRY HOLLAND said , that as great importance was attached to the exact date on which the information arrived at St. Petersburg from General Komaroff as to the Russian attack on the Afghans , he wished to know whether it was inconsistent with the nego - tiations now going on to instruct Sir Edward Thornton to learn on what date that information was received , either officially or otherwise ?
