# text = If it had been a question of the second reading , he would not have troubled the House on the matter ; but , as the Committee on this Bill would be a continuance of the great fight between Glasgow and Dundee , he would , if he was in Order , like to move the Bill be not considered until after the other Orders of the Day were disposed of .
