# text_id = 2066
# text = A great outcry is made when a picture by Raffaele , or by Murillo , or by any of the great masters , is allowed to leave the country ; but here we have a priceless gem , fresh from the hand of Nature , which we are asked to destroy for the benefit of a few local gentlemen who study only the advantage of their own pecuniary interests .
