# text_id = 2067
# text = It was a little grievous to him to hear , after the lapse of two years , insinuations made against the Government which he must either patiently listen to in silence , leaving the Government to be accused of treachery to the working men because they adopted what he moved and carried in the Committee , or else he must speak against men with whom he would prefer to work .
