# text_id = 2072
# text = When I look back upon what happened 50 or 60 years ago , upon the exorbitancy of crime in that country , under the pressure of difficulty and distress , perhaps not less than what now exists , I am amazed at the progress which they have made , at the self - command and self - control which is becoming more and more the habit of that country .
