# text_id = 2074
# text = This margin has many duties to perform , and , moreover , it is a margin which may disappear any day , because — and the right hon . Gentleman the Chancellor of the Exchequer will confirm me in this — circumstances very easy to foresee might make it impossible for the National Debt Commissioners to raise their money at less than 3 per cent , possibly 3 ¼ per cent .
