# text_id = 2077
# text = In the old times , the feeling in favour of education was so strong that there was little necessity for any compulsion whatever ; and , although there were now certain cases in which the parents neglected their duty , still , as a principle , he thought the system formerly existing acted soundly ; and he hoped the time would speedily arrive when they could return to it .
