# text_id = 2079
# text = The hon . Member for Barnstaple ( Sir Robert Carden ) also presented to the House a Petition in favour of the Motion signed by certain members of the Stock Exchange ; but he could not see that any special value attached to the document , inasmuch as it was not likely to be backed by any proposal emanating from the Stock Exchange for a scheme to create Candahar consols .
