# text = Was it meant to impeach those Members of Parliament who were members of the National League which came into existence five years ago , and which had existed during the last year under the sway of a most drastic Act of Parliament , and which the Lord Lieutenant could suppress with a stroke of the pen at any moment he chose if he saw any reason for such a course ?
