# text = As to the Two and Three - quarter per Cent Stock we propose to offer them £ 102 of that Stock , so that all the holders of Three per Cent Stock will have the option as soon as practicable , after the Bill is passed , of receiving £ 102 of Two and Three - quarter per Cent Stock , or £ 108 of Two and a - Half Stock .
