# text = Perhaps I ought to say , in replying to the right hon . Gentleman , that we have not received any confirmation of the reported defeat of the Russian Forces by the Chinese , and that the reports of such alleged defeat are not believed , so far as we are able to understand , by the Diplomatic Representatives of either Russia or China in this country at the present time .
