# text_id = 2088
# text = The hon . Member for Stoke - upon - Trent ( Mr. Broadhurst ) had urged upon the Committee the difficulties in the way of the conduct of Public Business ; but it should be borne in mind that those difficulties might , perhaps , rather tend to increase than be removed by the too hasty adoption of plans that might not be the best that could be desired .
