# text_id = 2090
# text = Mr. ANDERSON , in moving that the House go into Committee on the measure that day month , said , he was very much disappointed that the Chancellor of the Exchequer had made up his mind to go on with this Bill , after the very strong feeling expressed by the House , and after the appeal made to him at the previous Sitting , by the Leader of the Opposition .
