# text_id = 2091
# text = It was unnecessary for him to dilate at length upon the disadvantageous operation of this Treaty as far as we were concerned , because the whole matter had been fully explained the other day by the deputation from the Manchester Chamber of Commerce which had waited upon Mr. Bourke , in the absence — which all must regret — of the noble Marquess the Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs .
