# text_id = 2093
# text = He ( Mr. Healy ) proposed an Amendment during the last Session of Parliament , providing that the judicial rent should have a retrospective effect as regards arrears , so that if a man 's rent was reduced from £ 100 to £ 50 , and if he owed three years ' arrears , the amount he would have to pay would be £ 150 , instead of £ 300 .
