# text = He was indisposed to make a personal attack upon the right hon . Gentleman the late First Lord of the Admiralty ; but the House had a right to claim an explanation of how these transactions took place , which were altogether of an unbusiness like character , and which would never have been carried out if the parties carrying them out had been personally involved in the profit or loss .
