# text_id = 2100
# text = But I think so large and important a question could not , with advantage , be taken up at the instance of a single Member upon a Wednesday afternoon ; and that it would be a very great pity if some of the questions which the hon . Gentleman raises should be disposed of as summarily and suddenly as would necessarily be the case on an occasion like the present .
