# text = We are doing all this ; and if we find that we have a hard task before us , and are subjected , politically and diplomatically , to censure , we must be content to bear that censure , and to continue our efforts with un - diminished zeal and vigour , fortified by the consciousness that we are doing our duty , and conferring great good upon the Egyptian people .
