# text_id = 2103
# text = Under the head of " All Comers " there came to Wimbledon such men , for instance , as a mechanic , who had invented a new system of rifling , or a new sort of breech action ; or , perhaps , a Scotch laird , dressed in a suit of tweed , carrying a sporting rifle on each shoulder and with a black pipe in his mouth .
