# text_id = 2104
# text = This ordinary law is intended to be applied to ordinary crimes ; but you introduce by this Act of Parliament new crimes , a new procedure , and a new kind of examination of witnesses of an extraordinary character ; and it is no argument to say that you are going to apply the ordinary law of contempt when you are about to make a new offence under this Act .
