# text_id = 2105
# text = The hon . Member for Wolverhampton , in proposing a clause for the purpose of curtailing the Long Vacation , was now proceeding to deal with the position of an entirely different class of persons — namely , the clerks in the various offices of the Department , upon whom he was asking in effect that a greater amount of work should be imposed than they now had to perform .
