# text_id = 2106
# text = At the close of this long debate I certainly shall not trespass on the attention of the House , by endeavouring to review the whole of this complicated , and , as it seems to me , ill - omened Bill ; but I would ask leave to inquire what is the object of the Bill , and what are the purposes which the Government expect to attain by it ?
