# text_id = 2108
# text = Why , it was that which had been foretold , over and over again , by the Irish Members — they had foretold that the money which was given nominally for the purpose of giving the tenants employment , so as to save them from starvation , would be taken back by the landlords in the shape of arrears of rent , and that had turned out to be true .
