# text_id = 2109
# text = My Lords , I beg to offer my congratulations to the noble Marquess opposite upon his having had the good fortune , of which I have had my share during the past five years , to secure two noble Peers to do what seems an easy , but which is really a difficult thing — namely , to move and second the Address in answer to the Speech from the Throne .
