# text_id = 2110
# text = Let the tenants meet together , and decide what it is fair to ask , and if they are refused , there is but one course open to them if they are fighting according to the policy of brave men , that is , to pay a portion of the rent which they have offered to the landlord into the hands of two or three men whom they can trust .
