# text_id = 2112
# text = In my opinion , the intimation which the right hon . Gentleman the Chief Secretary has given of the intention of the Government to drop out the Bankruptcy Clauses will render necessary some other provisions relating more particularly to arrears , for that is a matter which must necessarily be dealt with , I am , therefore , unable to enter into any undertaking whatever not to move Amendments .
