# text_id = 2114
# text = Another reason why the Bill should be postponed was that the noble and learned Lord on the Woolsack implied that a great number of the signatures to the Petition , containing 60,000 of the inhabitants of the county of Durham , which was presented by his noble and learned Friend ( Lord Bramwell ) , were not really valid ; that it was a bogus Petition , or contained sham signatures .
