# text = The right hon . Gentleman had just assumed authority as the Lord High Commissioner , and upon this Resolution being communicated to him he sent back an answer pointing out that the form of proceeding was irregular , and containing the phrase " the Assembly has , through inadvertence , deviated from the Constitution , " and he suggested the regular mode of expressing the desire of the Assembly .
