# text_id = 2116
# text = I must confess that it appears to me very little is gained in the progress of the Business of the House by raising debates of this kind , in which an hon . Gentleman , after de- livering himself twice of his sentiments , concludes by saying that he will proceed no further at present , but that he will reserve to himself the right of raising the question again .
